== stdout
Register an existing brain directory on disk.

The brain stays where it is -- registration is in-place, no copy. For brains hosted on git, use ``git clone <url> <path>`` first, then ``kluris register <path>``.

  kluris register ~/brains/acme-sme

Usage: kluris register [OPTIONS] [SOURCE]

Arguments:
  [SOURCE]
          

Options:
      --json
          JSON output

      --help
          Show this message and exit.
